# Watch Candidates — {{ project_name }}

Log of recurring patterns, flaky behaviours, or systemic risks observed during QA
sessions. These are not bugs — they are candidates for a dedicated investigation or
a new automated regression guard.

## Purpose

When the `feedback-loop` rule identifies a recurring pattern worth tracking, log it here.
Review this backlog at the start of each sprint. Candidates that remain unresolved for
two or more sprints should be escalated to a tracked issue in {{ tracker_label if tracker != 'none' else "the project tracker" }}.

